
# Week 2 Flexbox Assignment

## Description

This project demonstrates CSS Flexbox using HTML and CSS only.

I created six boxes with different colors and used Flexbox to move them through all nine positions of a full-screen container.

## 9 Positions

1. Top Left
2. Top Center
3. Top Right
4. Middle Left
5. Center
6. Middle Right
7. Bottom Left
8. Bottom Center
9. Bottom Right

## Flexbox Properties Used

- `display: flex`
- `height: 100vh`
- `flex-direction`
- `flex-wrap`
- `gap`
- `justify-content`
- `align-items`

## Animation

I used CSS `@keyframes` and `animation-iteration-count: infinite` to move the boxes continuously through the nine positions.

No JavaScript was used.

